{"speciesId":810,"names":{"fr":"Ouistempo","es":"Grookey","en":"Grookey","ja":"サルノリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Le rythme qu’il crée en tapant avec son bâton très spécial génère des ondes sonores qui ont le pouvoir de vivifier les plantes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al marcar el ritmo con su baqueta especial, produce unas ondas sonoras capaces de devolver la vitalidad a la flora."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat, the sound waves produced carry revitalizing energy to the plants and flowers in the area."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"特別な スティックで リズムを 刻むと 草花を 元気にする パワーが 音波になって 広がる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il attaque en frappant frénétiquement avec son bâton. Son enthousiasme grandit à mesure que le rythme s’accélère."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Ataca golpeando sin cesar con su baqueta, con un entusiasmo que crece a medida que acelera el ritmo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It attacks with rapid beats of its stick. As it strikes with amazing speed, it gets more and more pumped."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"スティックの 連打で 攻撃。 すごい スピードで 叩くうちに どんどん テンションが 上がるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":810,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},